<description>&lt;p&gt;Police chiefs are tightening security along Thailand's borders as Thailand and Myanmar begin joint water-quality monitoring of border rivers and China dispatches experts to investigate Mekong pollution at the Thai-Myanmar frontier. A Chanthaburi man confessed to an acid attack on his wife, while a father and son were jailed for smuggling about £500,000 of cannabis from Thailand. Thailand and Cambodia are deepening economic ties with the ASEAN Express rail freight service even as Thailand's CP All will close all 7-Eleven stores in Cambodia and Thais have donated 269 million baht for a Thai-Cambodian border fence and shelters. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNSFV0bF9MNjc1Vi1qN1BXVTJjc2pvN1FkMXlsU2FVT3lSVWUwaHBiRHVqUUFDUWN4Y24yNGlOMHQ0ZEVmemJfdzNYbW1HTWxqR3hiSXRxYnkxVHN4Zjh4YXA1amx0cmU0MjVsTDBKTDJzLXMyVjdTa0oxYkxURmNBZzJxd1Jra2RobnlfcmpUaVB2Z0dsb0RIWE1RSi14blp3QXRTclR6bEpaTVk2b09idFVJQngzQllvdGxwLWpoQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNcTVrbHJRM3VXSFBOeDUyNE1vNkUta2s3X2RrTWk4U213MEtLNHEwZmVTOVFGbUlHVkdNMUczM2RzN1U4eW1Hd0tkdVZqMkp6ZFJOeXFoeVJ3NXIwSzUxZEdZbzBxangyLTcxclYzRUIwMk04cnlyalg1V2w2dkctY1pnTWVVdHZkeFRjOGlnT1lRcVMxZy1r?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bilyonaryo Business&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE4zRGQ4VGxHdmlOUjFpSzBpNlhEUDVPMC1JRDdzTHpWRFg0ZW9ENFQ5c3VuZl8xaERlb1gzaGdTZ3NWMGk3dUZ2M0NRTnBMbF82Z